{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a07d28bc-1fbc-8df0-84f8-bdf62f1410dd",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T11:18:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dennis Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:13:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:13:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Yes, hello. My name is Dennis Quinn. I am calling about a storm drain, in front of my place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:13:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Quinn, sure. What's going on with the drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:13:35-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is not working well. It makes a, um, a grunting sound, and the water goes down very slow. When the snow melts a little, the water comes up and sits in the street. Every thaw, the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:13:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it backs up whenever there's a thaw. Is it raining right now, or is this just melt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:13:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No rain. No storm. It is dry weather, just some sun and the ice melts. Then the drain cannot take it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:14:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Dry weather, just meltwater, and the drain's slow and gurgling. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:14:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "459 Coggeshall Avenue. In Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:14:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four fifty-nine Coggeshall Avenue. Did I say that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:14:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Four five nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:14:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And is the water getting into your property, or is it staying out in the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:14:34-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the street. But the sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit. When the water goes away it leaves everything behind. Very slippery. People walk to my shop and they slide."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:14:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, so you've got a shop there. Mud and grit all over the sidewalk, and it's slippery for folks coming in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:14:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Small shop. It is an ice cream shop. We are closed now for winter, but we open again in April. I want the sidewalk clean before then, and the drain also."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:15:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, April's not that far off. So you'd like somebody to look at the drain and probably clean it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:15:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please. I think something is blocking? Leaves, maybe sand. I cannot see inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:15:26-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's usually what it is, debris packed down in the catch basin. I'll put in a request for a crew to inspect it and clear it. Let me get your phone number in case they need to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:15:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. 401-555-0181."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:15:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight one. Is that a landline?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:15:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, landline. I am here most days, but not always. If nobody answers, they can leave a message?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:15:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, they can leave a message. Now, has this been reported before, that you know of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:16:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think maybe one time, a neighbor said so. I do not know when. I did not call before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:16:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's okay. I'll note it as a recurring problem at that location, since it happens every thaw. That helps the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:16:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. Um, may I ask? Do the crews work on weekends? Because during the week I am busy at the shop, doing repairs inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:16:33-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They can, depending on what's going on and how many calls are stacked up. I can't tell you for sure it'd be a weekend. But you don't need to be there. They work from the street, so nobody has to let them in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. I do not need to be there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:16:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, not for a drain out front. They'll just come by, check it, and clear it if they can. If it's something bigger, like a broken pipe underneath, that gets scheduled differently."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:17:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. A broken pipe, that would be worse?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be, but let's not get ahead of ourselves. Most of the time it's just clogged. They'll tell us once they've looked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:17:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the sidewalk? The mud?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:17:27-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll mention the sidewalk in the notes. Usually once the drain's working, the water stops pooling and leaving that silt behind. Cleaning the sidewalk itself might be on you as the property owner, but I'll flag it so the crew sees it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:17:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I understand. I can sweep, no problem. But if the drain stays the same, the mud comes again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:17:52-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's the point. Fix the drain first. So let me read back what I've got: four fifty-nine Coggeshall Avenue, storm drain in front slow and backing up on thaws, no rain involved, mud and grit on the sidewalk, and you'd like it cleared before April. Anything I'm missing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:18:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all correct. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:18:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Quinn. Somebody will follow up. If it gets really deep out there or freezes over bad, call us back and we'll bump the note."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:18:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will. Thank you very much. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:18:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now, take care."
    }
  ],
